NOTICE — Third-party Gazebo models vendored in this repository
==============================================================

The directory src/tb3_frontier_exploration/models/ contains five Gazebo
Classic models copied verbatim from a local Gazebo model cache
(~/.gazebo/models). These models were originally distributed through the
Gazebo model database (the online library historically fetched by Gazebo
Classic from models.gazebosim.org, maintained in the OSRF "gazebo_models"
repository, https://github.com/osrf/gazebo_models). They are vendored here so
that the simulation works offline on a fresh machine, because the online
model database is deprecated and slow/unreliable to fetch from.

IMPORTANT — license status: NONE of the five model directories contains a
bundled LICENSE/COPYING file. The information below is a verbatim
transcription of each model's model.config metadata (the only
authorship/licensing-related information shipped inside the model
directories). No compliance judgement has been made; licensing must be
reviewed manually before public redistribution. (For reference only: the
upstream osrf/gazebo_models repository declares its content to be
Apache License 2.0 / CC-BY 4.0 at repository level, but the vendored copies
themselves carry no license text.)

